# Ask the robot's assistant something in plain words: /assistant/ask, served by the assistant node.
# Answered when the assistant has finished: it may look things up on the robot first (a few seconds).
string conversation   # chosen by the asker: the same id carries on a conversation, a new one starts afresh
string text           # what the user said
---
bool success          # false: the assistant could not answer (no API key, no internet, ...); `reply` says why
string reply          # the answer, in plain words
string[] tools_used   # what the assistant looked at or did on the robot, in order (for tests and the log)
uint8[] picture_jpeg  # a picture that goes with the answer (what the camera saw); empty if none
float64[] mark        # a place on the map that goes with the answer: x, y (metres); empty if none
